Final Setup & Deployment Instructions

Prerequisites: Ensure you have Node.js, Go, Encore, and Git installed.

Backend Setup:

Navigate to the backend/ directory.

Run encore run in your terminal. Encore will start your local development environment and provide you with a local API URL (e.g., http://localhost:4000).

Frontend Setup:

In a separate terminal, navigate to the frontend/ directory.

Create a file named .env.local.

Inside .env.local, add the following line, replacing the URL with the one from Encore:

code
Code
